    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shade</strong> is an immersive, first person\u00a0<strong>psychological horror game</strong> which follows the story of Arthur Bell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day presents <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>new tasks</strong> and duties at the manor immersing the player deep into the mysterious and intense story of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hired to maintain a remote manor in Finland, Arthur Bell uncovers dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological thriller about isolation and unraveling minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features &amp; Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue with the characters that give player different answering options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fear creating scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
